# FoodHub Command Center

Multi-agent analytics over FoodHub orders: ask questions in plain English, see generated graphs,
and watch a live dashboard (React + Vite, FastAPI, SQLite).

Run locally:

```bash
npm --prefix foodhub-ui ci && npm --prefix foodhub-ui run build
uvicorn app:app --port 7860      # open http://localhost:7860
```